    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏvālis</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		ovo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to an ovation</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ovalis corona murtea est: eā
					utebantur imperatores qui ovantes urbem introibant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					5, 6, 20</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 195</span></i> Müll.</div>
